msgctxt "01N0301"
msgid "No way!"
msgstr "No way!"

msgctxt "01N0302"
msgid ""
"Wow! I've never seen one like this before. It looks just like Studly, only "
"smaller."
msgstr ""
"Wow! I've never seen one like this before. It looks just like Studly, only "
"smaller."

msgctxt "01N0303"
msgid "Ah! Not so fast, Wilbur! His head's floppy!"
msgstr "Ah! Not so fast, Wilbur! His head's floppy!"

msgctxt "01N0304"
msgid ""
"I mean, it's broken. There's no spring in it, so his head's flopping all "
"over the place. No trade."
msgstr ""
"I mean, it's broken. There's no spring in it, so his head's flopping all "
"over the place. No trade."

msgctxt "01N0401"
msgid "It's also very broken. Take a hike, Wilbur!"
msgstr "It's also very broken. Take a hike, Wilbur!"

msgctxt "01N0402"
msgid "You fix it, then we'll talk, grasshoppers!"
msgstr "You fix it, then we'll talk, grasshoppers!"

msgctxt "01N0403"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "You're welcome."

msgctxt "01N0501"
msgid "Hey, who are you trying to fool? It's still broken!"
msgstr "Hey, who are you trying to fool? It's still broken!"

msgctxt "01N0701"
msgid "Let me see it!"
msgstr "Let me see it!"

msgctxt "01N0702"
msgid "Hey, it works great!"
msgstr "Hey, it works great!"

msgctxt "01N0801"
msgid "No way!"
msgstr "No way!"

msgctxt "01N0802"
msgid ""
"Wow! I've never seen one like this before. It looks just like Studly, only "
"smaller."
msgstr ""
"Wow! I've never seen one like this before. It looks just like Studly, only "
"smaller."

msgctxt "01N0901"
msgid ""
"Okay, Wilbur. It's a trade. They're in the icebox outside Verus. Go help "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Okay, Wilbur. It's a trade. They're in the icebox outside Verus. Go help "
"yourself."

msgctxt "01N1001"
msgid "I can't give you these grasshoppers, I'm using them!"
msgstr "I can't give you these grasshoppers, I'm using them!"

msgctxt "01N1002"
msgid "Duh! To keep them frozen!"
msgstr "Duh! To keep them frozen!"

msgctxt "01N1003"
msgid ""
"They are fresh, Wilbur. They'll start hopping around like crazy once you "
"thaw them out."
msgstr ""
"They are fresh, Wilbur. They'll start hopping around like crazy once you "
"thaw them out."

msgctxt "01N1004"
msgid "Why use my mom's microwave? Well, when she's not looking."
msgstr "Why use my mom's microwave? Well, when she's not looking."

msgctxt "01N1005"
msgid ""
"Grasshoppers are hard to come by most of the year, except every spring "
"there's tons of them down at the marsh. I catch a year's supply in the "
"spring and keep them on ice so I have fresh bait all year round."
msgstr ""
"Grasshoppers are hard to come by most of the year, except every spring "
"there's tons of them down at the marsh. I catch a year's supply in the "
"spring and keep them on ice so I have fresh bait all year round."

msgctxt "01N1006"
msgid "Because my mom says I can't keep them in her freezer."
msgstr "Because my mom says I can't keep them in her freezer."

msgctxt "01N1007"
msgid ""
"Hey, no prob! And if you ever need any frisky termites, I can make you a "
"heck of a deal!"
msgstr ""
"Hey, no prob! And if you ever need any frisky termites, I can make you a "
"heck of a deal!"

msgctxt "01N1301"
msgid "I don't want that."
msgstr "I don't want that."

msgctxt "01N14011"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with that?"
msgstr "What am I supposed to do with that?"

msgctxt "01N14012"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr "I don't think so."

msgctxt "01N14013"
msgid "Stop wasting my time, Wilbur!"
msgstr "Stop wasting my time, Wilbur!"

msgctxt "01N14014"
msgid "Can't you see I'm busy?"
msgstr "Can't you see I'm busy?"

msgctxt "01N14015"
msgid "Get a life, Wilbur!"
msgstr "Get a life, Wilbur!"

msgctxt "01N14016"
msgid "That's nothing but junk, Wilbur!"
msgstr "That's nothing but junk, Wilbur!"

msgctxt "01N15011"
msgid ""
"Look, I appreciate the puzzle dispenser, but I don't want anything else."
msgstr ""
"Look, I appreciate the puzzle dispenser, but I don't want anything else."

msgctxt "01N15012"
msgid "I don't want that! Go away and let me fish!"
msgstr "I don't want that! Go away and let me fish!"

msgctxt "01N15013"
msgid "Leave me alone! I don't want any more of your stuff!"
msgstr "Leave me alone! I don't want any more of your stuff!"

msgctxt "01N1601"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "You're welcome."

msgctxt "01N1701"
msgid ""
"Hey, no prob! And if you ever need any frisky termites, I can make you a "
"heck of a deal."
msgstr ""
"Hey, no prob! And if you ever need any frisky termites, I can make you a "
"heck of a deal."

msgctxt "01P0301"
msgid "Check it out, Odie! A studly McQuark pause dispenser!"
msgstr "Check it out, Odie! A studly McQuark pause dispenser!"

msgctxt "01P0302"
msgid "Wait! It's an official limited edition collector's item!"
msgstr "Wait! It's an official limited edition collector's item!"

msgctxt "01P0303"
msgid "Give me some grasshoppers, and it's yours!"
msgstr "Give me some grasshoppers, and it's yours!"

msgctxt "01P0304"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "What do you mean?"

msgctxt "01P0401"
msgid "But it's very rare!"
msgstr "But it's very rare!"

msgctxt "01P0402"
msgid "Hmm... what if I fix it?"
msgstr "Hmm... what if I fix it?"

msgctxt "01P0403"
msgid "Thanks for nothing, Odie."
msgstr "Thanks for nothing, Odie."

msgctxt "01P0701"
msgid "I fixed the puzzle dispenser, Odie!"
msgstr "I fixed the puzzle dispenser, Odie!"

msgctxt "01P0801"
msgid "Check it out, Odie! A studly McQuark Puzz Dispenser!"
msgstr "Check it out, Odie! A studly McQuark Puzz Dispenser!"

msgctxt "01P0802"
msgid "By the way, it's an official limited edition collector's item."
msgstr "By the way, it's an official limited edition collector's item."

msgctxt "01P0803"
msgid "Well, give me some grasshoppers, and it's yours!"
msgstr "Well, give me some grasshoppers, and it's yours!"

msgctxt "01P1001"
msgid "Can I just take some from your bait box?"
msgstr "Can I just take some from your bait box?"

msgctxt "01P1002"
msgid "Why are they in an icebox?"
msgstr "Why are they in an icebox?"

msgctxt "01P1003"
msgid "I thought you said your bait was fresh."
msgstr "I thought you said your bait was fresh."

msgctxt "01P1004"
msgid "Well, how do you saw him out?"
msgstr "Well, how do you saw him out?"

msgctxt "01P1005"
msgid "Why do you keep them frozen?"
msgstr "Why do you keep them frozen?"

msgctxt "01P1006"
msgid "Why do you keep them at Verus?"
msgstr "Why do you keep them at Verus?"

msgctxt "01P1007"
msgid "Thanks, kid."
msgstr "Thanks, kid."

msgctxt "01P1101"
msgid "I'll trade you this for some grasshoppers."
msgstr "I'll trade you this for some grasshoppers."

msgctxt "01P1601"
msgid "Thanks for nothing, Odie."
msgstr "Thanks for nothing, Odie."

msgctxt "01P1701"
msgid "Thanks, kid."
msgstr "Thanks, kid."

msgctxt "02N0301"
msgid "Trying to steal from a kid? Nice, Wilbur."
msgstr "Trying to steal from a kid? Nice, Wilbur."

msgctxt "02N04011"
msgid "Nice try, Wilbur."
msgstr "Nice try, Wilbur."

msgctxt "02N04012"
msgid "Pick on someone your own size, Wilbur!"
msgstr "Pick on someone your own size, Wilbur!"

msgctxt "02N04013"
msgid "Get your paws off my bait!"
msgstr "Get your paws off my bait!"

msgctxt "02N04014"
msgid "You're starting to bug me, Wilbur!"
msgstr "You're starting to bug me, Wilbur!"

msgctxt "02N04015"
msgid "You don't give up, do ya?"
msgstr "You don't give up, do ya?"

msgctxt "02N04016"
msgid "Get lost, will ya? You're scaring the fish!"
msgstr "Get lost, will ya? You're scaring the fish!"

msgctxt "02N0601"
msgid ""
"Hey! Hands off! I'm using them! I told you where the frozen ones are, so "
"leave me alone!"
msgstr ""
"Hey! Hands off! I'm using them! I told you where the frozen ones are, so "
"leave me alone!"

msgctxt "02N07011"
msgid "Don't you have to meet your little space friends or something, Wilbur?"
msgstr "Don't you have to meet your little space friends or something, Wilbur?"

msgctxt "02N07012"
msgid "You try that once more, and I'm screaming for the cops!"
msgstr "You try that once more, and I'm screaming for the cops!"

msgctxt "02N07013"
msgid "Don't even think about it!"
msgstr "Don't even think about it!"

msgctxt "03N0201"
msgid "They're not!"
msgstr "They're not!"

msgctxt "03N0301"
msgid "No way! Big old trout's jumping like crazy, and I'm gonna catch him!"
msgstr "No way! Big old trout's jumping like crazy, and I'm gonna catch him!"

msgctxt "03N0401"
msgid "Yep, best fishing spot in the whole of Boonesville."
msgstr "Yep, best fishing spot in the whole of Boonesville."

msgctxt "03N0402"
msgid ""
"Harry says this is the exact spot where he caught that big fish on the wall "
"in his barber shop."
msgstr ""
"Harry says this is the exact spot where he caught that big fish on the wall "
"in his barber shop."

msgctxt "03N0403"
msgid "It's summer, Wilbur."
msgstr "It's summer, Wilbur."

msgctxt "03N0404"
msgid "Fresh bait!"
msgstr "Fresh bait!"

msgctxt "03N0405"
msgid ""
"I used to use worms, but I didn't like them. Ugh, too slimy. So, now I use "
"grasshoppers."
msgstr ""
"I used to use worms, but I didn't like them. Ugh, too slimy. So, now I use "
"grasshoppers."

msgctxt "03N0407"
msgid ""
"Oh, the new Studly McQuark flick is awesome! I saw it five times already, "
"and that was just on Saturday!"
msgstr ""
"Oh, the new Studly McQuark flick is awesome! I saw it five times already, "
"and that was just on Saturday!"

msgctxt "03N0408"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, I have all his comics, gum cards, and action figures. I'm also a "
"member of the Study McQuark fan club."
msgstr ""
"Oh yeah, I have all his comics, gum cards, and action figures. I'm also a "
"member of the Study McQuark fan club."

msgctxt "03N0409"
msgid "Yeah. See ya!"
msgstr "Yeah. See ya!"

msgctxt "03N0501"
msgid "Well, sometimes I just don't feel good enough to go to school."
msgstr "Well, sometimes I just don't feel good enough to go to school."

msgctxt "03N0502"
msgid ""
"Yeah, isn't that funny? You know what? I bet the fresh air does me good."
msgstr ""
"Yeah, isn't that funny? You know what? I bet the fresh air does me good."

msgctxt "03N0601"
msgid "Yep, the trout get one look at them, and they just start to slobberin'."
msgstr ""
"Yep, the trout get one look at them, and they just start to slobberin'."

msgctxt "03N0602"
msgid "No, not yet. But last week, I caught an old rubber boot!"
msgstr "No, not yet. But last week, I caught an old rubber boot!"

msgctxt "03N0603"
msgid "I don't use no sissy lures!"
msgstr "I don't use no sissy lures!"

msgctxt "03N0604"
msgid "No way! They'll hop out of the box, Wilbur! I don't want to lose any!"
msgstr "No way! They'll hop out of the box, Wilbur! I don't want to lose any!"

msgctxt "03N0605"
msgid "Yeah, whatever."
msgstr "Yeah, whatever."

msgctxt "03N0606"
msgid "Forget it. But, I do know where you can get some."
msgstr "Forget it. But, I do know where you can get some."

msgctxt "03N0607"
msgid ""
"Hey, I don't want your money! Say, what do you want with grasshoppers "
"anyway, Wilbur?"
msgstr ""
"Hey, I don't want your money! Say, what do you want with grasshoppers "
"anyway, Wilbur?"

msgctxt "03N0608"
msgid "Yeah. See ya!"
msgstr "Yeah. See ya!"

msgctxt "03N0701"
msgid "Don't worry. One way or another, that trout will be mine."
msgstr "Don't worry. One way or another, that trout will be mine."

msgctxt "03N0801"
msgid "It'll cost you a buck to find out!"
msgstr "It'll cost you a buck to find out!"

msgctxt "03N0802"
msgid "Suit yourself!"
msgstr "Suit yourself!"

msgctxt "03N0902"
msgid "Suit yourself!"
msgstr "Suit yourself!"

msgctxt "03N1001"
msgid "Oh, at the pet store. Where you work?"
msgstr "Oh, at the pet store. Where you work?"

msgctxt "03N1002"
msgid "Oh, that's too bad! You really should, you know."
msgstr "Oh, that's too bad! You really should, you know."

msgctxt "03N1101"
msgid ""
"In that case, they're definitely not for sale. I don't need any competition."
msgstr ""
"In that case, they're definitely not for sale. I don't need any competition."

msgctxt "03N1102"
msgid "Hey, you and Stole even hit in the same bottle?"
msgstr "Hey, you and Stole even hit in the same bottle?"

msgctxt "03N1103"
msgid ""
"Yeah? What are you gonna be, the clown? Oh man, Wilbur. You gotta see ol' "
"Doc Hooper. He's starting to sound pretty nutso."
msgstr ""
"Yeah? What are you gonna be, the clown? Oh man, Wilbur. You gotta see ol' "
"Doc Hooper. He's starting to sound pretty nutso."

msgctxt "03N1201"
msgid "And if I give you some grasshoppers, will all be saved?"
msgstr "And if I give you some grasshoppers, will all be saved?"

msgctxt "03N1202"
msgid "My mom always told me to stay away from you. Now I see why."
msgstr "My mom always told me to stay away from you. Now I see why."

msgctxt "03P0201"
msgid "Hi, Odie. How are they biting today?"
msgstr "Hi, Odie. How are they biting today?"

msgctxt "03P0301"
msgid "Hey, Odie! Not giving up, huh?"
msgstr "Hey, Odie! Not giving up, huh?"

msgctxt "03P0401"
msgid "You fish here every day?"
msgstr "You fish here every day?"

msgctxt "03P0402"
msgid "What's so special about this spot?"
msgstr "What's so special about this spot?"

msgctxt "03P0403"
msgid "Shouldn't you be in school?"
msgstr "Shouldn't you be in school?"

msgctxt "03P0404"
msgid "Hey, what's in the box?"
msgstr "Hey, what's in the box?"

msgctxt "03P0405"
msgid "What kind of bait do you use?"
msgstr "What kind of bait do you use?"

msgctxt "03P0406"
msgid "About your grasshoppers..."
msgstr "About your grasshoppers..."

msgctxt "03P0407"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr "Seen any good movies lately?"

msgctxt "03P0408"
msgid "You must be a big Stanley McQuark fan."
msgstr "You must be a big Stanley McQuark fan."

msgctxt "03P0409"
msgid "Well, good luck! I gotta go now!"
msgstr "Well, good luck! I gotta go now!"

msgctxt "03P0501"
msgid "Oh yeah, but I've seen you here in the spring and fall, too."
msgstr "Oh yeah, but I've seen you here in the spring and fall, too."

msgctxt "03P0502"
msgid "But you feel good enough to fish, huh?"
msgstr "But you feel good enough to fish, huh?"

msgctxt "03P0601"
msgid "Well, they sure are lively little suckers."
msgstr "Well, they sure are lively little suckers."

msgctxt "03P0602"
msgid "Any bites yet?"
msgstr "Any bites yet?"

msgctxt "03P0603"
msgid "Well, maybe you should try using lures instead."
msgstr "Well, maybe you should try using lures instead."

msgctxt "03P0604"
msgid "Can I see your grasshoppers?"
msgstr "Can I see your grasshoppers?"

msgctxt "03P0605"
msgid "I remember when you were knee-high to one."
msgstr "I remember when you were knee-high to one."

msgctxt "03P0606"
msgid "Can I buy some from you?"
msgstr "Can I buy some from you?"

msgctxt "03P0607"
msgid "Are you sure they're not for sale?"
msgstr "Are you sure they're not for sale?"

msgctxt "03P0608"
msgid "Well, good luck. I gotta go now."
msgstr "Well, good luck. I gotta go now."

msgctxt "03P0701"
msgid "A rubber boot? Do you mean you haven't caught any fish here all summer?"
msgstr ""
"A rubber boot? Do you mean you haven't caught any fish here all summer?"

msgctxt "03P0801"
msgid "Hey, where can I get some grasshoppers?"
msgstr "Hey, where can I get some grasshoppers?"

msgctxt "03P0802"
msgid "Never mind, I don't want any."
msgstr "Never mind, I don't want any."

msgctxt "03P0901"
msgid "Well, well, Odie, you drive a hard bargain, but..."
msgstr "Well, well, Odie, you drive a hard bargain, but..."

msgctxt "03P0902"
msgid "A dollar? Forget it!"
msgstr "A dollar? Forget it!"

msgctxt "03P1001"
msgid "There you go. Now, where can I get some grasshoppers?"
msgstr "There you go. Now, where can I get some grasshoppers?"

msgctxt "03P1002"
msgid "But we don't sell grasshoppers."
msgstr "But we don't sell grasshoppers."

msgctxt "03P1101"
msgid "Hey, I want to go fishing too."
msgstr "Hey, I want to go fishing too."

msgctxt "03P1102"
msgid "I'm gonna be abducted by aliens!"
msgstr "I'm gonna be abducted by aliens!"

msgctxt "03P1103"
msgid "I'm starting a miniature grasshopper circus."
msgstr "I'm starting a miniature grasshopper circus."

msgctxt "03P1201"
msgid ""
"I'm telling you the truth. They're testing me to see if humans are "
"intelligent. Odie, if I fail these tests, they're gonna eat us!"
msgstr ""
"I'm telling you the truth. They're testing me to see if humans are "
"intelligent. Odie, if I fail these tests, they're gonna eat us!"

msgctxt "03P1202"
msgid "Hopefully."
msgstr "Hopefully."

msgctxt "04N0201"
msgid "Well, there's always something good on TV. Here, check this out."
msgstr "Well, there's always something good on TV. Here, check this out."

msgctxt "04N0202"
msgid ""
"I don't know, more than I can watch, but that don't stop me from trying."
msgstr ""
"I don't know, more than I can watch, but that don't stop me from trying."

msgctxt "04N0203"
msgid ""
"I just kind of surf from channel to channel and let it all wash over me. "
"Hey, you know I can get Baywatch in over 80 languages now?"
msgstr ""
"I just kind of surf from channel to channel and let it all wash over me. "
"Hey, you know I can get Baywatch in over 80 languages now?"

msgctxt "04N0204"
msgid ""
"You betcha! I got a 96-inch Jumbotron on order from Fast Freddy's Discount "
"Electronics. It has five times the screen area as the one I got now."
msgstr ""
"You betcha! I got a 96-inch Jumbotron on order from Fast Freddy's Discount "
"Electronics. It has five times the screen area as the one I got now."

msgctxt "04N0205"
msgid ""
"Well, let me put it this way. I can watch reruns of Charlie's Angels at any "
"time of the day or night now."
msgstr ""
"Well, let me put it this way. I can watch reruns of Charlie's Angels at any "
"time of the day or night now."

msgctxt "04N0206"
msgid "Oh, it's working just fine. Well, except for those dang pigeons."
msgstr "Oh, it's working just fine. Well, except for those dang pigeons."

msgctxt "04N0207"
msgid ""
"Oh, they keep landing on it and moving it so it points in the wrong "
"direction. Don't really message up my TV reception."
msgstr ""
"Oh, they keep landing on it and moving it so it points in the wrong "
"direction. Don't really message up my TV reception."

msgctxt "04N0208"
msgid ""
"Is that so? Well, you just be sure to tell them to keep their flying saucers "
"away from those TV satellites up there. I'm having enough trouble with "
"pigeons mucking with my dish down here."
msgstr ""
"Is that so? Well, you just be sure to tell them to keep their flying saucers "
"away from those TV satellites up there. I'm having enough trouble with "
"pigeons mucking with my dish down here."

msgctxt "04N02091"
msgid "Well, step right up."
msgstr "Well, step right up."

msgctxt "04N02092"
msgid "I already cut your hair, you fool kid."
msgstr "I already cut your hair, you fool kid."

msgctxt "04N0210"
msgid "What do you want to know?"
msgstr "What do you want to know?"

msgctxt "04N0211"
msgid ""
"Huh? Oh, well actually, it's been pretty slow lately. You're the only one "
"who's been in here all week."
msgstr ""
"Huh? Oh, well actually, it's been pretty slow lately. You're the only one "
"who's been in here all week."

msgctxt "04N0301"
msgid "Ah, you're so young, Wilbur."
msgstr "Ah, you're so young, Wilbur."

msgctxt "04N0401"
msgid ""
"It was driving me nuts. I must have been up in that roof at least a dozen "
"times last week, shooing off them birds and re-aiming the dish."
msgstr ""
"It was driving me nuts. I must have been up in that roof at least a dozen "
"times last week, shooing off them birds and re-aiming the dish."

msgctxt "04N0402"
msgid ""
"Well, that's because I put a stair-crow up on the roof. Mm-hmm. Birds ain't "
"gone near that dish ever since."
msgstr ""
"Well, that's because I put a stair-crow up on the roof. Mm-hmm. Birds ain't "
"gone near that dish ever since."

msgctxt "04N0403"
msgid ""
"Yep, works like a charm. It even scared the wife. She thinks it looks like "
"me."
msgstr ""
"Yep, works like a charm. It even scared the wife. She thinks it looks like "
"me."

msgctxt "04N0404"
msgid "Okay Wilbur, don't be a stranger."
msgstr "Okay Wilbur, don't be a stranger."

msgctxt "04N0501"
msgid "I was wondering how much longer you was gonna let that mop grow."
msgstr "I was wondering how much longer you was gonna let that mop grow."

msgctxt "04N0502"
msgid ""
"Now, how about that piece that keeps falling in your eyes? Want me to snip "
"it?"
msgstr ""
"Now, how about that piece that keeps falling in your eyes? Want me to snip "
"it?"

msgctxt "04N0503"
msgid "Kids today, with their long hair and love beads."
msgstr "Kids today, with their long hair and love beads."

msgctxt "04N0601"
msgid ""
"Oh, they say it's dangerous. Supposedly, it seeps right into your brain. But "
"you know, even if that is the case, I gotta tell you, that blue concoction "
"is the best dang styling wax I ever used!"
msgstr ""
"Oh, they say it's dangerous. Supposedly, it seeps right into your brain. But "
"you know, even if that is the case, I gotta tell you, that blue concoction "
"is the best dang styling wax I ever used!"

msgctxt "04N0602"
msgid ""
"It works miracles, Wilbur. Especially on dry, staticky, fly-away hair like "
"Mayor Gus has. No wonder he don't stop using it, even though it's supposed "
"to be unhealthy and all."
msgstr ""
"It works miracles, Wilbur. Especially on dry, staticky, fly-away hair like "
"Mayor Gus has. No wonder he don't stop using it, even though it's supposed "
"to be unhealthy and all."

msgctxt "04N0603"
msgid ""
"Economics, Wilbur. Toxic waste is cheap, cheap, cheap. Them hot dog guys "
"said you can pick up a barrel for a song."
msgstr ""
"Economics, Wilbur. Toxic waste is cheap, cheap, cheap. Them hot dog guys "
"said you can pick up a barrel for a song."

msgctxt "04N0604"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was a hot dog manufacturer that leaked the news to the hair "
"channel. They was mad that the hair wax guys were moving in on their "
"supplier."
msgstr ""
"Yeah, it was a hot dog manufacturer that leaked the news to the hair "
"channel. They was mad that the hair wax guys were moving in on their "
"supplier."

msgctxt "04N0605"
msgid ""
"The toxic waste came from the chemical factory over in Sheldonburg. The hair "
"channel correspondent said they're doing some kind of superconductor "
"research up there. Wait a minute... You know, I'll bet that's why the wax "
"works so well on dry, staticky, fly-away hair. That superconductive toxic "
"waste probably just conducts the static electricity away."
msgstr ""
"The toxic waste came from the chemical factory over in Sheldonburg. The hair "
"channel correspondent said they're doing some kind of superconductor "
"research up there. Wait a minute... You know, I'll bet that's why the wax "
"works so well on dry, staticky, fly-away hair. That superconductive toxic "
"waste probably just conducts the static electricity away."

msgctxt "04N0606"
msgid "Well, you can thank my satellite dish for that."
msgstr "Well, you can thank my satellite dish for that."

msgctxt "04N0607"
msgid ""
"Nah, he was always a few tacos short of a combination plate. But since he's "
"been using that stuff, he says the fillings in his teeth are picking up "
"better radio stations."
msgstr ""
"Nah, he was always a few tacos short of a combination plate. But since he's "
"been using that stuff, he says the fillings in his teeth are picking up "
"better radio stations."

msgctxt "04N0608"
msgid "See ya, Robo."
msgstr "See ya, Robo."

msgctxt "04N0701"
msgid "Oh, I don't mind. It lets me get caught up in all my soaps."
msgstr "Oh, I don't mind. It lets me get caught up in all my soaps."

msgctxt "04N0702"
msgid ""
"Well, I've been meaning to sweep that up. And I will! Just as soon as I get "
"a little bit of free time."
msgstr ""
"Well, I've been meaning to sweep that up. And I will! Just as soon as I get "
"a little bit of free time."

msgctxt "04N0703"
msgid ""
"Well, that's because Stolie broke it the other day. Shoot, I caught him red-"
"handed trying to jimmy it open. He said he wanted to see where all the "
"stripes were disappearing to."
msgstr ""
"Well, that's because Stolie broke it the other day. Shoot, I caught him red-"
"handed trying to jimmy it open. He said he wanted to see where all the "
"stripes were disappearing to."

msgctxt "04N0704"
msgid "Later, Wilber!"
msgstr "Later, Wilber!"

msgctxt "04P0201"
msgid "Anything good on the tube?"
msgstr "Anything good on the tube?"

msgctxt "04P0202"
msgid "How many channels do you get now?"
msgstr "How many channels do you get now?"

msgctxt "04P0203"
msgid "How do you decide which show to watch?"
msgstr "How do you decide which show to watch?"

msgctxt "04P0204"
msgid "Could you possibly watch any more TV?"
msgstr "Could you possibly watch any more TV?"

msgctxt "04P0205"
msgid "Sounds like you're pretty happy with your dish."
msgstr "Sounds like you're pretty happy with your dish."

msgctxt "04P0206"
msgid "How's your new satellite dish working?"
msgstr "How's your new satellite dish working?"

msgctxt "04P0207"
msgid "What are the pigeons doing to your dish?"
msgstr "What are the pigeons doing to your dish?"

msgctxt "04P0208"
msgid "Did I mention that I've been abducted by aliens?"
msgstr "Did I mention that I've been abducted by aliens?"

msgctxt "04P0209"
msgid "I'd like a haircut, please."
msgstr "I'd like a haircut, please."

msgctxt "04P0210"
msgid "About that toxic hair styling wax..."
msgstr "About that toxic hair styling wax..."

msgctxt "04P0211"
msgid "Well, judging by the floor, business must be booming!"
msgstr "Well, judging by the floor, business must be booming!"

msgctxt "04P0301"
msgid "Wow! Uh, what is Charlie's Angels?"
msgstr "Wow! Uh, what is Charlie's Angels?"

msgctxt "04P0401"
msgid "Sounds like a frustrating problem."
msgstr "Sounds like a frustrating problem."

msgctxt "04P0402"
msgid "The dish seems to be working okay now!"
msgstr "The dish seems to be working okay now!"

msgctxt "04P0403"
msgid "A scarecrow? That's a clever solution."
msgstr "A scarecrow? That's a clever solution."

msgctxt "04P0404"
msgid "Happy channel surfing! I have to go now."
msgstr "Happy channel surfing! I have to go now."

msgctxt "04P0503"
msgid "Nope, just a little off the sides, please."
msgstr "Nope, just a little off the sides, please."

msgctxt "04P0601"
msgid "Isn't toxic waste a little dangerous?"
msgstr "Isn't toxic waste a little dangerous?"

msgctxt "04P0602"
msgid "What's so great about this hair wax?"
msgstr "What's so great about this hair wax?"

msgctxt "04P0603"
msgid "Why did they make their hair wax out of toxic waste?"
msgstr "Why did they make their hair wax out of toxic waste?"

msgctxt "04P0604"
msgid "Hot dog, guys!"
msgstr "Hot dog, guys!"

msgctxt "04P0605"
msgid "Who was the toxic waste supplier?"
msgstr "Who was the toxic waste supplier?"

msgctxt "04P0606"
msgid "You're just a warehouse of information, Harry!"
msgstr "You're just a warehouse of information, Harry!"

msgctxt "04P0607"
msgid "Did the toxic wax make Mayor Gus crazy?"
msgstr "Did the toxic wax make Mayor Gus crazy?"

msgctxt "04P0608"
msgid "Thanks for the info, Harry! Gotta run!"
msgstr "Thanks for the info, Harry! Gotta run!"

msgctxt "04P0701"
msgid "No other customers all week? Too bad."
msgstr "No other customers all week? Too bad."

msgctxt "04P0702"
msgid "Then why is there so much hair on the floor?"
msgstr "Then why is there so much hair on the floor?"

msgctxt "04P0703"
msgid "I noticed that your barber pole isn't turning."
msgstr "I noticed that your barber pole isn't turning."

msgctxt "04P0704"
msgid "Well, the whole business picks up. Gotta go!"
msgstr "Well, the whole business picks up. Gotta go!"

msgctxt "05N0101"
msgid "Now, how about some styling wax to keep that awful cowlick down?"
msgstr "Now, how about some styling wax to keep that awful cowlick down?"

msgctxt "05N0201"
msgid "Alrighty then."
msgstr "Alrighty then."

msgctxt "05N0202"
msgid "The blue wax. Oh, can't use that on you. Nope, nope, no can do."
msgstr "The blue wax. Oh, can't use that on you. Nope, nope, no can do."

msgctxt "05N0203"
msgid ""
"Oh, Willbear, nobody has the dry look anymore. All the hip cats go for "
"grease and oil."
msgstr ""
"Oh, Willbear, nobody has the dry look anymore. All the hip cats go for "
"grease and oil."

msgctxt "05N0204"
msgid "Eh, suit yourself. But don't come crying to me if you get spread ends."
msgstr "Eh, suit yourself. But don't come crying to me if you get spread ends."

msgctxt "05N0301"
msgid "Heh, you're telling me!"
msgstr "Heh, you're telling me!"

msgctxt "05N0401"
msgid "Forget it!"
msgstr "Forget it!"

msgctxt "05N0402"
msgid "I said no!"
msgstr "I said no!"

msgctxt "05N0403"
msgid "For the last time, NO!"
msgstr "For the last time, NO!"

msgctxt "05N0404"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr "NO!"

msgctxt "05N0405"
msgid ""
"Because it belongs to Mayor Gus. If he found out I used it on you, probably "
"jack up my taxes again."
msgstr ""
"Because it belongs to Mayor Gus. If he found out I used it on you, probably "
"jack up my taxes again."

msgctxt "05N0406"
msgid ""
"It's been impossible to get ever since they banned it and yanked it off the "
"shelves, so it's a little toxic. Big deal."
msgstr ""
"It's been impossible to get ever since they banned it and yanked it off the "
"shelves, so it's a little toxic. Big deal."

msgctxt "05N0407"
msgid ""
"Gus used to buy that stuff by the truckload. He still has a few cases left "
"over from before it was banned. He keeps a bottle here for his weekly "
"mustache trim, under the strict provision that I don't let no one else have "
"any."
msgstr ""
"Gus used to buy that stuff by the truckload. He still has a few cases left "
"over from before it was banned. He keeps a bottle here for his weekly "
"mustache trim, under the strict provision that I don't let no one else have "
"any."

msgctxt "05N0408"
msgid ""
"Well, it turns out it's made out of toxic waste. There was a big expose "
"about it on the hair channel. 24 hours of nothing but hair. Now, that's "
"entertainment."
msgstr ""
"Well, it turns out it's made out of toxic waste. There was a big expose "
"about it on the hair channel. 24 hours of nothing but hair. Now, that's "
"entertainment."

msgctxt "05N0409"
msgid "You got it!"
msgstr "You got it!"

msgctxt "05N0410"
msgid "Suit yourself, but don't come crying to me if you get spread ends."
msgstr "Suit yourself, but don't come crying to me if you get spread ends."

msgctxt "05N0501"
msgid "It's about time."
msgstr "It's about time."

msgctxt "05N0601"
msgid ""
"Oh, they say it's dangerous. Supposedly it seeps right into your brain. But "
"you know, even if that is the case, I gotta tell ya, that blue concoction is "
"the best dang styling wax I ever used."
msgstr ""
"Oh, they say it's dangerous. Supposedly it seeps right into your brain. But "
"you know, even if that is the case, I gotta tell ya, that blue concoction is "
"the best dang styling wax I ever used."

msgctxt "05N0602"
msgid ""
"It works miracles, Wilbur. Especially on dry, staticky flyaway hair like "
"Mayor Gus has. Well, it's no wonder he don't stop using it. Even though it's "
"supposed to be unhealthy and all."
msgstr ""
"It works miracles, Wilbur. Especially on dry, staticky flyaway hair like "
"Mayor Gus has. Well, it's no wonder he don't stop using it. Even though it's "
"supposed to be unhealthy and all."

msgctxt "05N0603"
msgid ""
"Economics, Wilbur. Toxic waste is cheap, cheap, cheap. Why, them hot dog "
"guys said you can pick up a barrel for a song."
msgstr ""
"Economics, Wilbur. Toxic waste is cheap, cheap, cheap. Why, them hot dog "
"guys said you can pick up a barrel for a song."

msgctxt "05N0604"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was a hot dog manufacturer that leaked the news to the hair "
"channel. They was mad that the hair wax guys were moving in on their "
"supplier."
msgstr ""
"Yeah, it was a hot dog manufacturer that leaked the news to the hair "
"channel. They was mad that the hair wax guys were moving in on their "
"supplier."

msgctxt "05N0605"
msgid ""
"The toxic waste came from the chemical factory over in Sheldonburg. The hair "
"channel correspondent said they're doing some kind of superconductor "
"research up there. Wait a minute... You know, I'll bet that's why the wax "
"works so well on dry, staticky, fly-away hair. That superconductive toxic "
"waste probably just conducts the static electricity away."
msgstr ""
"The toxic waste came from the chemical factory over in Sheldonburg. The hair "
"channel correspondent said they're doing some kind of superconductor "
"research up there. Wait a minute... You know, I'll bet that's why the wax "
"works so well on dry, staticky, fly-away hair. That superconductive toxic "
"waste probably just conducts the static electricity away."

msgctxt "05N0606"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you can thank my satellite dish for that. Oops, that reminds me. "
"Reggie and Katie Lee are on soon. Do you want some wax or not?"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, you can thank my satellite dish for that. Oops, that reminds me. "
"Reggie and Katie Lee are on soon. Do you want some wax or not?"

msgctxt "05N0607"
msgid ""
"Nah, he was always a few tacos short of a combination plate. But since he's "
"been using that stuff, he says the fillings in his teeth are picking up "
"better radio stations."
msgstr ""
"Nah, he was always a few tacos short of a combination plate. But since he's "
"been using that stuff, he says the fillings in his teeth are picking up "
"better radio stations."

msgctxt "05N0608"
msgid "You got it!"
msgstr "You got it!"

msgctxt "05N0609"
msgid "Eh, suit yourself. But don't come crying to me if you get spread ends."
msgstr "Eh, suit yourself. But don't come crying to me if you get spread ends."

msgctxt "05P0201"
msgid "Don't mind if I do!"
msgstr "Don't mind if I do!"

msgctxt "05P0202"
msgid "Sure! I'll have some of that funky blue wax!"
msgstr "Sure! I'll have some of that funky blue wax!"

msgctxt "05P0203"
msgid "Nah, I go for the dry look."
msgstr "Nah, I go for the dry look."

msgctxt "05P0204"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "No thanks."

msgctxt "05P0301"
msgid "Then, uh... I guess I'm just not HIP."
msgstr "Then, uh... I guess I'm just not HIP."

msgctxt "05P0401"
msgid "Come on, Harry! Give me some of the blue wax!"
msgstr "Come on, Harry! Give me some of the blue wax!"

msgctxt "05P0402"
msgid "PLEASE!"
msgstr "PLEASE!"

msgctxt "05P0403"
msgid "Pretty please?"
msgstr "Pretty please?"

msgctxt "05P0404"
msgid "Pretty pleased with pralines on top?"
msgstr "Pretty pleased with pralines on top?"

msgctxt "05P0405"
msgid "Why can't I have the blue wax?"
msgstr "Why can't I have the blue wax?"

msgctxt "05P0406"
msgid "Why don't you get your own blue hair styling wax?"
msgstr "Why don't you get your own blue hair styling wax?"

msgctxt "05P0407"
msgid "Well, if it's banned, then how did Mayor Gus get it?"
msgstr "Well, if it's banned, then how did Mayor Gus get it?"

msgctxt "05P0408"
msgid "What makes you think that blue goop is toxic?"
msgstr "What makes you think that blue goop is toxic?"

msgctxt "05P0409"
msgid "Just give me the regular hair wax."
msgstr "Just give me the regular hair wax."

msgctxt "05P0410"
msgid "I'll skip the wax."
msgstr "I'll skip the wax."

msgctxt "05P0501"
msgid "Oh, I give up."
msgstr "Oh, I give up."

msgctxt "05P0601"
msgid "Ah, isn't toxic waste a little dangerous?"
msgstr "Ah, isn't toxic waste a little dangerous?"

msgctxt "05P0602"
msgid "What's so great about it?"
msgstr "What's so great about it?"

msgctxt "05P0603"
msgid "Why did they make their hair wax out of toxic waste?"
msgstr "Why did they make their hair wax out of toxic waste?"

msgctxt "05P0604"
msgid "HOT DOG, GUYS!"
msgstr "HOT DOG, GUYS!"

msgctxt "05P0605"
msgid "Who is the toxic waste supplier?"
msgstr "Who is the toxic waste supplier?"

msgctxt "05P0606"
msgid "You're just a warehouse of information, Harry!"
msgstr "You're just a warehouse of information, Harry!"

msgctxt "05P0607"
msgid "Did the toxic wax make Gus crazy?"
msgstr "Did the toxic wax make Gus crazy?"

msgctxt "05P0608"
msgid "Just give me the regular hair wax."
msgstr "Just give me the regular hair wax."

msgctxt "05P0609"
msgid "I'll skip the wax."
msgstr "I'll skip the wax."

msgctxt "06N0101"
msgid "Alright, Wilbur. That'll be eight buckaroos."
msgstr "Alright, Wilbur. That'll be eight buckaroos."

msgctxt "06N0201"
msgid ""
"Well, a haircut is still just five bucks. The extra three goes to pay for my "
"new satellite dish."
msgstr ""
"Well, a haircut is still just five bucks. The extra three goes to pay for my "
"new satellite dish."

msgctxt "06N0203"
msgid "You don't have a tab, Wilbur."
msgstr "You don't have a tab, Wilbur."

msgctxt "06N0204"
msgid ""
"That's what all you long-haired kids say. Oh, alright. Pay me next time, "
"Wilbur."
msgstr ""
"That's what all you long-haired kids say. Oh, alright. Pay me next time, "
"Wilbur."

msgctxt "06N0205"
msgid "Broke!"
msgstr "Broke!"

msgctxt "06N0301"
msgid "Kid still looks like a sheepdog."
msgstr "Kid still looks like a sheepdog."

msgctxt "06P0201"
msgid "But my last haircut was only five bucks!"
msgstr "But my last haircut was only five bucks!"

msgctxt "06P0202"
msgid "Alright, eight bucks it is."
msgstr "Alright, eight bucks it is."

msgctxt "06P0203"
msgid "Put it on my tab, Harry!"
msgstr "Put it on my tab, Harry!"

msgctxt "06P0204"
msgid "Come on, I'm good for it!"
msgstr "Come on, I'm good for it!"

msgctxt "06P0205"
msgid "Actually, I'm kinda broke right now."
msgstr "Actually, I'm kinda broke right now."

msgctxt "06P0301"
msgid "See ya, Harry!"
msgstr "See ya, Harry!"

msgctxt "100B001"
msgid "Hey, get off of the road!"
msgstr "Hey, get off of the road!"

msgctxt "100B002"
msgid "This bridge ain't big enough for the both of us, kid."
msgstr "This bridge ain't big enough for the both of us, kid."

msgctxt "100B003"
msgid "What do you know? The new bridge is open!"
msgstr "What do you know? The new bridge is open!"

msgctxt "101H001"
msgid "You again? I thought I told you to get lost."
msgstr "You again? I thought I told you to get lost."

msgctxt "101H002"
msgid "And stay out!"
msgstr "And stay out!"

msgctxt "101H003A"
msgid "I said, stay out!"
msgstr "I said, stay out!"

msgctxt "101H003B"
msgid "That's punks like you that are ruining this country!"
msgstr "That's punks like you that are ruining this country!"

msgctxt "101H003C"
msgid "Kids, I'm glad that old war injury kept me from having any."
msgstr "Kids, I'm glad that old war injury kept me from having any."

msgctxt "101H003D"
msgid "Stay out, you dang hooligan! I'll give you a shearing you won't forget!"
msgstr ""
"Stay out, you dang hooligan! I'll give you a shearing you won't forget!"

msgctxt "101H003E"
msgid ""
"Don't think I can't handle a miserable shab like you. I was a barber in the "
"Navy!"
msgstr ""
"Don't think I can't handle a miserable shab like you. I was a barber in the "
"Navy!"

msgctxt "101H003F"
msgid "Set foot in here one more time and I'll shit the sheriff on ya!"
msgstr "Set foot in here one more time and I'll shit the sheriff on ya!"

msgctxt "101W001"
msgid "Harry's Barbershop is a Boonesville landmark."
msgstr "Harry's Barbershop is a Boonesville landmark."

msgctxt "101W002"
msgid "I'd better stay out. Harry's in a bad mood."
msgstr "I'd better stay out. Harry's in a bad mood."

msgctxt "101W004"
msgid ""
"That letter saved Harry's life when he had the big hair fire in his barber "
"shop a few years ago."
msgstr ""
"That letter saved Harry's life when he had the big hair fire in his barber "
"shop a few years ago."

msgctxt "101W006"
msgid "That's the way in!"
msgstr "That's the way in!"

msgctxt "101W006B"
msgid "This place went out of business ages ago."
msgstr "This place went out of business ages ago."

msgctxt "101W007"
msgid "Closed. You gotta love Banker's Hours!"
msgstr "Closed. You gotta love Banker's Hours!"

msgctxt "101W008"
msgid ""
"There hasn't been a decent movie here since the last Dudley McClark flick."
msgstr ""
"There hasn't been a decent movie here since the last Dudley McClark flick."

msgctxt "101W009"
msgid ""
"It's all locked up. The sheriff can't stand paperwork, so he doesn't spend a "
"lot of time at the office."
msgstr ""
"It's all locked up. The sheriff can't stand paperwork, so he doesn't spend a "
"lot of time at the office."

msgctxt "101W010"
msgid ""
"That's the shop where I work. It's the only decent paying job in town that "
"doesn't involve tossing hogs."
msgstr ""
"That's the shop where I work. It's the only decent paying job in town that "
"doesn't involve tossing hogs."

msgctxt "101W011"
msgid ""
"It's closed until tomorrow. I'll have to get my own key from the boss one of "
"these days."
msgstr ""
"It's closed until tomorrow. I'll have to get my own key from the boss one of "
"these days."

msgctxt "101W012"
msgid ""
"The volunteer fire station is empty unless there's a fire. Or it happens to "
"be Poker Night."
msgstr ""
"The volunteer fire station is empty unless there's a fire. Or it happens to "
"be Poker Night."

msgctxt "101W013"
msgid ""
"Aunt Polly smashed into this fireplug twice before they revoked her driver's "
"license."
msgstr ""
"Aunt Polly smashed into this fireplug twice before they revoked her driver's "
"license."

msgctxt "101W014"
msgid "How am I going to use that on a fireplug?"
msgstr "How am I going to use that on a fireplug?"

msgctxt "101W015"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The sheriff put a Denver boot on his own mother's truck!"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe it! The sheriff put a Denver boot on his own mother's truck!"

msgctxt "101W016"
msgid ""
"Even if I did know how to hotwire it, this jalopy is not going anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Even if I did know how to hotwire it, this jalopy is not going anywhere."

msgctxt "101W500"
msgid ""
"Wait a minute. This isn't where I was abducted from. One o'clock! This isn't "
"when I was abducted from either! It was closer to two! Oh, this is really "
"weird. I wonder if this means that I'm going to be abducted again."
msgstr ""
"Wait a minute. This isn't where I was abducted from. One o'clock! This isn't "
"when I was abducted from either! It was closer to two! Oh, this is really "
"weird. I wonder if this means that I'm going to be abducted again."

msgctxt "101W501"
msgid ""
"Wow! I was abducted again, and now I'm back here. Something definitely went "
"wrong. I'm in some kind of time warp."
msgstr ""
"Wow! I was abducted again, and now I'm back here. Something definitely went "
"wrong. I'm in some kind of time warp."

msgctxt "101W502"
msgid "Deja vu!"
msgstr "Deja vu!"

msgctxt "101W503"
msgid "These alien tests can really give you a headache."
msgstr "These alien tests can really give you a headache."

msgctxt "101W504"
msgid "Here I go again."
msgstr "Here I go again."

msgctxt "101W505"
msgid "If at first you don't succeed..."
msgstr "If at first you don't succeed..."

msgctxt "101W506"
msgid "Oh, brother!"
msgstr "Oh, brother!"

msgctxt "101W520"
msgid ""
"Oh, well. At least I got through the neuro test. I'll go grab some of that "
"crazy hair wax again so I can concentrate on figuring out how to pass the "
"second test."
msgstr ""
"Oh, well. At least I got through the neuro test. I'll go grab some of that "
"crazy hair wax again so I can concentrate on figuring out how to pass the "
"second test."

msgctxt "101W521"
msgid "Those mutant gerbils are nasty!"
msgstr "Those mutant gerbils are nasty!"

msgctxt "101W522"
msgid ""
"Okay, I know how to nuke the mutant gerbils, but I still have to figure out "
"how to get out of that cage."
msgstr ""
"Okay, I know how to nuke the mutant gerbils, but I still have to figure out "
"how to get out of that cage."

msgctxt "101W523"
msgid "This time I'll do it."
msgstr "This time I'll do it."

msgctxt "101W524"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Hmm..."

msgctxt "101W530"
msgid ""
"Shoot! Just when I thought I was on a winning streak, I'd better go get the "
"stuff I used to pass the first two tests so that I can focus on the third!"
msgstr ""
"Shoot! Just when I thought I was on a winning streak, I'd better go get the "
"stuff I used to pass the first two tests so that I can focus on the third!"

msgctxt "101W531"
msgid ""
"If Perkins isn't going to let me look for that burger, I'd better find a way "
"to get him off of that island of his."
msgstr ""
"If Perkins isn't going to let me look for that burger, I'd better find a way "
"to get him off of that island of his."

msgctxt "101W532"
msgid ""
"This is nuts! I guess I'd better keep at it, or we'll end up extinct like "
"the dinosaurs."
msgstr ""
"This is nuts! I guess I'd better keep at it, or we'll end up extinct like "
"the dinosaurs."

msgctxt "101W533"
msgid ""
"Alright, I know how to get Perkins off his island. Now all I have to figure "
"out is how to find that Orion burger."
msgstr ""
"Alright, I know how to get Perkins off his island. Now all I have to figure "
"out is how to find that Orion burger."

msgctxt "101W534"
msgid "Amplify my senses? Hmm..."
msgstr "Amplify my senses? Hmm..."

msgctxt "101W550"
msgid ""
"Three tests down, and who knows how many more to go. Well, I'll go get the "
"stuff that I know I'll need so that I can concentrate on figuring out what "
"else I'll need."
msgstr ""
"Three tests down, and who knows how many more to go. Well, I'll go get the "
"stuff that I know I'll need so that I can concentrate on figuring out what "
"else I'll need."

msgctxt "101W551"
msgid "That bork could use a breath mint!"
msgstr "That bork could use a breath mint!"

msgctxt "101W552"
msgid "I seem to be making progress, albeit slowly."
msgstr "I seem to be making progress, albeit slowly."

msgctxt "101W570"
msgid "I'll go grab the stuff I used to get this far."
msgstr "I'll go grab the stuff I used to get this far."

msgctxt "101W571"
msgid "This is crazy!"
msgstr "This is crazy!"

msgctxt "102H001"
msgid "Good afternoon, Wilbur."
msgstr "Good afternoon, Wilbur."

msgctxt "102H002A"
msgid "Back to soon."
msgstr "Back to soon."

msgctxt "102H002B"
msgid "Howdy, woobah!"
msgstr "Howdy, woobah!"

msgctxt "102H002C"
msgid "You forget something?"
msgstr "You forget something?"

msgctxt "102H003"
msgid ""
"Yep, everything is exactly where I need it. Heck, I can reach for stuff and "
"I don't even have to look."
msgstr ""
"Yep, everything is exactly where I need it. Heck, I can reach for stuff and "
"I don't even have to look."

msgctxt "102H004"
msgid "Darn tootin' ya can't. I got it bolted to the floor."
msgstr "Darn tootin' ya can't. I got it bolted to the floor."

msgctxt "102H005"
msgid ""
"Don't, don't you be messing with that Wilbur. I got everything arranged just "
"the way I like it."
msgstr ""
"Don't, don't you be messing with that Wilbur. I got everything arranged just "
