msgid "Yeah, it's the heat that kills them."
msgstr "Yeah, it's the heat that kills them."

msgctxt "35N0805"
msgid "Well, what do you want me to do about it? Call the branch manager!"
msgstr "Well, what do you want me to do about it? Call the branch manager!"

msgctxt "35N0806"
msgid "Well, don't let me keep you."
msgstr "Well, don't let me keep you."

