msgstr "Oh, which one looks tasty today, boss?"

msgctxt "706F002"
msgid "The scrawny one? Whatever you say, boss."
msgstr "The scrawny one? Whatever you say, boss."

msgctxt "706F003"
msgid "A human? Oh dear. What does a human look like, boss?"
msgstr "A human? Oh dear. What does a human look like, boss?"

