msgstr "Uh, no. At least no one other than my gym teacher."

msgctxt "707W009"
msgid "Hey, we just saved the Earth, didn't we?"
msgstr "Hey, we just saved the Earth, didn't we?"

msgctxt "707W010"
msgid "I've never done anything like that before in my whole life!"
msgstr "I've never done anything like that before in my whole life!"

msgctxt "707W010Z"
msgid ""
"Look at me. Some little guy from some little town. One minute I'm selling "
