msgid "Oh no... NOT YOU AGAIN!"
msgstr "Oh no... NOT YOU AGAIN!"

msgctxt "707Z010"
msgid "Outnumbered? Perhaps. But outwitted? Never."
msgstr "Outnumbered? Perhaps. But outwitted? Never."

